  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consultative Group on International Agricultural Research, CGIAR, research is dedicated to reducing rural poverty, increasing food security, improving human health and nutrition, and ensuring more sustainable management of natural resources. It is carried out by 15 Centers, that are members of the CGIAR Consortium, in close collaboration with hundreds of partner organizations, including national and regional research institutes, civil society organizations, academia, and the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
